  {
   "key": "0x16",
   "name": "noise generator",
   "aliases": [
    "noise colour",
    "Nn1 Nn0"
   ],
   "regions": [
    {
     "ref": "datasheet:SAA1099.raw.txt",
     "lines": "401-402"
    },
    {
     "ref": "datasheet:SAA1099.raw.txt",
     "lines": "445-451"
    },
    {
     "ref": "datasheet:SAA1099.raw.txt",
     "lines": "149-158"
    },
    {
     "ref": "mame:src/devices/sound/saa1099.cpp",
     "function": "saa1099_device::data_w",
     "case": [
      "0x16"
     ]
    },
    {
     "ref": "dosbox-x:src/hardware/mame/saa1099.cpp",
     "lines": "434-437"
    }
   ],
   "rows": [
    {
     "n": "1",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "Register 16 holds two noise generator fields, N11 and N10 for one generator and N01 and N00 for the other.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:SAA1099.raw.txt",
       "lines": "401-402",
       "sha": "d54115467c2e29dc4ade6b0a0461e674100e3ae9c45f00fea94d443eb51782d3"
      },
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:SAA1099.raw.txt",
       "lines": "445-446",
       "sha": "485058ceab4fb23a261ea654f0143ca1a05a09574a85cf85e26d0607a31233f4"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "2",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "The two bits select 31,3 kHz, 15,6 kHz, 7,6 kHz, or the paired frequency generator's rate.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:SAA1099.raw.txt",
       "lines": "447-451",
       "sha": "10a06b3c48ed0b39c82947ad8f21d587c67dd76ab0d81448110c5ad0adfd3724"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "3",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "The noise is software controlled through a frequency generator or is one of three predefined noises.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:SAA1099.raw.txt",
       "lines": "150-153",
       "sha": "e427db57fd986baeed1680015264007f0d173c740c2ffeb6e6504ceb8f143d6b"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "4",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "When noise and tone are mixed the tone's amplitude is increased to equalise the levels.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:SAA1099.raw.txt",
       "lines": "156-158",
       "sha": "6cf712e1a06ba8590f92c0a1440ba276851ea7b559c6649294af59c728f8eef1"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "6",
     "on": "is",
     "of": "doc",
     "text": "Noise generator 0 mixes with frequency generators 0 to 2 and noise generator 1 with 3 to 5.",
     "quotes": [
      {
       "ref": "datasheet:SAA1099.raw.txt",
       "lines": "154-156",
       "sha": "ec7cce7c965e4f1701b066a2d34ce576215b55a7fe081adcf44c38aceab9257f"
      }
     ]
    },
    {
     "n": "5",
